n silently narrowed out.\n\nReturn a corrected exact draft and matrix before independent review. Cross-reconcile current R1f4ed2dab and R2 revision2 rather than treating their earlier drafts as settled contracts. R4 may continue its design-only proof/test-budget inventory against these named unresolved decisions; no measurements or provider experiments are authorized by this correction. The useful-invariant 10× test goal remains. The existing independent review boundary and pending R0/joint017018 invitations remain unchanged; no restricted reviewer restart, replacement, model switch or rephrasing. This reading/correction is not independent approval, architecture adoption, task satisfaction or source authorization.","body":{"head":"43b68f5a6d1f1a68bcb494062fa2db0e081f7ef9","no_git_artifact":"true","scope":"Complete first-draft reading and planning correction; no independent verdict, adoption, task closure or source authorization."}}